WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.340
Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier, and welcome to "Enter the Gungeon"!

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:07.400
Just judging by the music, and the music is fricking AWESOME here,

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.860
This game is going to be incredible.

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:12.300
It's actually a top seller, even though it's a new release on Steam.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:15.940
'The Marine'. I don't- oh! I'm character selecting. Okay.

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:19.000
'The Convict'? Who looks like a.. VERY angry lady.

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:25.380
Cocky pilot... The marine... The hunter with a dog... Oh!

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.120
So I got a choice here.

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:30.600
That guy has kinda like the fohawk that I had before and kinda red hair

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:32.920
but she has a dog.... Oh,

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:36.640
I'd love to go around with Chica because I got Chica in the room right now!

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.520
She's laying down over there. She's very tired, she's been playing all day.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:40.700
So I'm gonna go with that one.

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:44.100
Who are you? Enter co-op? I don't have any friends!

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:47.640
I got no-one to play with. I'm literally by myself forever and ever and ever.

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:49.160
Where does this go?! [Totally not the Gungeon!]

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:51.920
Hi- okay. I guess I WON'T go in there.

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:54.780
Have a nice day! I'll go fuck myself. It's great.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.080
Okay, so I see I should have just gone North.

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:02.600
This would've been the obvious choice, but then again I'm incredibly stupid. HI!

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:05.600
[Mark as NPC voice] "Well what do we have here?
You must be a new arrival."

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:09.420
"Lemme guess. Here to change the past, right? Well you're not the first."

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:11.540
"But there's no salvation here."

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:14.560
"I was like you once, came to change the past."

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:16.400
"And now I have no future..."

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:17.940
[Mark as NPC laughing]

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:19.720
Well, maybe it's because you drank it all away.

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:20.900
Alright, here we go!

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:24.500
Now, the only thing I know about this game is that it has to do with guns

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.940
and it's kind of a bullet hell... ?

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:28.560
"The Halls of Knowledge", Okay

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:31.460
Hello. HI! Anybody here to kill me?

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:33.340
Anybody here for me to kill- Hello o_o

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:36.320
[Mark as NPC] "WAYWARD SOUL! Approach me and press A to speak!"

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:38.820
"For it is I, Ser Manuel!"

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:42.520
"Heed my words and I shall show you how
to survive this accursed labyrinth."

00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:43.180
*snotty inhale*

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:45.460
"Continue through the door to begin the tutelage."

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:48.320
[Mark's normal voice] OKAY!!!! ON MY WAY TEACHER!!!

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.180
[Mark as NPC] "Try flipping these tables or kicking barrels with the A button."

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:53.900
[Mark's normal voice] Yeah, fuck that table! Yeah, fuck that barrel!

00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:56.780
AND FUCK ALL Y'ALL!!!! HEHEHE!!

00:01:57.040 --> 00:01:59.180
[Mark as NPC] "Excellent interacting. Proceed to the next room."

00:01:59.189 --> 00:02:01.049
[Mark's normal voice] Wait, I'm not done fucking all the barrels!

00:02:01.049 --> 00:02:02.889
AAAAHAHA! Okay. I'm done.

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:07.440
Alright, moving on. You're such a good teacher. What is this? Is this bad?

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:12.840
[Mark as NPC] "This is the most important lesson:
you can dodge roll by pressing L bumper and a direction."

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:16.039
"Invulnerable for the
first half of the dodge..."

00:02:16.039 --> 00:02:18.119
[Mark's normal voice] Okay... *understanding aaah*

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:20.300
Okay! Gotcha! Okay.

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:23.180
I can do it! I'm on it! In it to win it!

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:24.620
Do it!

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:25.980
aaaaAAAH BOINK!

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:27.660
heheheh! BOINK! hehehehah!

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:29.140
BOINK! That's awesome!

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:30.800
BOINK! *childish laughter*

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:32.920
Ooh, what? Is this not good enough?

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:34.160
Oh, thank you! *laughs*

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:35.780
[Still giggling] That door was very angry with me.

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:37.820
[Mark's normal voice] I love this game already!

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:38.780
HEEEAH!

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:39.980
*giggling*

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:41.140
This is so cool!

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:42.360
HAAAhahah!

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:45.920
I mean, I know it's very simplistic, and obviously
this is just a game but whatever. It's cool.

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:48.400
Oh, okay, nevermind - I already did it!

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:50.160
I did the challenge because I'm really good at games.

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:51.700
Ah fuck this barrel! Okay...

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:56.160
[Mark as NPC] "Avoid dying... number of bullets can be overwhelming..." 
[Mark's normal voice] Oh hello!

00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:59.820
[Mark as NPC] "for instan- no dodging through that, 
but there's a way to clear a path."

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:01.140
"BLANKS."

