00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:10.319
"They will also push nearby enemies away. Great if you need a second to reposition."

00:03:10.319 --> 00:03:12.599
"Pick them up by over-" 
[Mark's normal voice] ooOOh. Okay that's handy-dandy.

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:13.820
Okay...

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:16.660
Okay got it. BOINK!!!!!!

00:03:16.740 --> 00:03:18.860
WOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!! Alrighty then.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:19.760
Good for me.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:20.700
FUCK ALL Y'ALL!

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.100
Okay. 
[Mark as NPC] "Excellent!"

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:24.880
"Blanks refill every floor, so use them when you need to!"

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:28.700
"They can also be found through out the Gungeon, but I wouldn't rely on that... Onward!!"

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:30.520
[Mark's normal voice] Okay! Thanks boss!!!

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:32.360
Excuse me- HUAH!

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:34.980
Alright, FUCK YOU!!! FUCK YES!

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:36.360
FUCK ALL Y'ALL!!!!

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:37.460
*laughs menacingly* okay

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:38.620
HOOP!

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:40.040
Am I supposed to talk to you?

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:42.520
[Mark as NPC] "You got the basics, 
I suppose you've earned a reward:"

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:45.020
