[Mark's normal voice] COOL!!!

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:47.900
Sweet! It's a pea shooter! Quite literally.

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:50.420
*laughs* Oh, it IS a pea shooter. Oh, okay.

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:53.840
Alrighty then. Reload... [reading] "First you need something to shoot."

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:57.260
"One of the Gungeon's natural inhabitants... cruel, savage, and bloodthirsty."

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:00.020
AH GOD! It's a... it's a bullet!?

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:01.820
Oh okay.

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:03.500
[as NPC] "Now, that's why it's called a Gungeon."

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:04.340
"Kill him!"

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:05.600
[Mark's normal voice] Well, that's a little...

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:06.640
Wait.

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:09.820
Oh. Right bumper shoots...?

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:12.040
Oh that's gonna be- Oh, that's gonna be hard.

