00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:27.080
Okay, bye teacher! Hueeaugh! *more Mark sound effects*

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:29.400
How do I reload? Oh, like that!

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:33.300
*shooting, sounds of joy, laughing*

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:34.780
I'm killing bullets!

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.220
*more laughing*

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:38.800
Heaagh! Books! HEEaagh! *giggle*

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:41.120
Sorry, I'm having a little too much fun on this one.

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:41.900
HEOOP!

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:43.720
You wanna dance with me, brah?

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:45.620
