00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:47.440
HOOP! hahahahah!

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:50.000
I'm too good for y'all! *laughs*

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.500
I don't know why I'm saying "y'all." I'm not even from Kentucky.

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:53.560
I'm from Cincinnati.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:54.790
u-WOAH! Hello!

00:04:54.790 --> 00:05:00.310
That guy means business. HEP! Okay, well, he doesn't mean business no more.

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:05.940
[as NPC] "Over here!" 
[as Mark] Hello! I made it!
[as NPC] "You know how to dodge, roll, shoot, and use blanks, but there's more to learn."

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:10.220
"You need to know how to use items that don't exist in gun form. This Medkit, for example."

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:13.220
"It will replenish your health. Pick it up by pshereblahblahblah" *done reading*

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:15.380
Okay. "You've got plenty of health, so don't use it"...

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.020
"Right trigger button to use it."

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:18.560
Man, why the right trigger?

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:20.960
Okay, now-

00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:22.740
Yeah, that's much, that's much better!

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:23.560
Yeah, much better.

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:24.860
"Go on." Okay boss!

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:25.800
HAHAHAHA!

