00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:34.100
"To use it, open the map by left trigger-"

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:34.920
[bleep]

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:38.140
Okay. Alright. It's actually left BUMPER now.

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:39.780
Okay...

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:43.480
How do I get over to it? I wasn't paying attention to anything that you were saying!

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:45.020
You are old man!

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:45.860
 

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:46.720
I'm no- "Whoops."

00:05:46.720 --> 00:05:47.600
Oh, shit!

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:48.880
I didn't- [thud] Okay.

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:49.760
What-

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:51.660
Ohhh!

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:53.560
That's right, okay. I shouldn't skip over.

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:55.160
There are literally- ahh, okay.

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:58.740
GOT IT! Okay, I can teleport to the Teleporter any time. *Fumbling over words*

00:05:58.740 --> 00:05:59.800
*Inhale*

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:01.860
Okay, they won't work if I'm in combat,

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:04.460
"press 'A' while standing on the portal to teleport back where you were"...

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:06.300
"Should explore... better find the boss".

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:08.440
OKAY! I'LL FIND THE BOSS!

