00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:22.820
Fine, Ser Manuel.

00:07:23.340 --> 00:07:23.840
Hup!

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:27.340
There you go! Aw you're going to lose it now.

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:30.660
Nope, nope no no. Why did you give me a pea shooter?

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:33.640
It's almost as if he really wanted me to lose this because

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:36.380
obviously he's a little bit better at this than me,

00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:39.480
considering how many guns- how many bullets he can shoot at me-

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:40.420
Sorry, trying to think.

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:42.180
Think and move at the same time.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:42.750
Quite difficult.

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:45.560
Hup!

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:47.100
I actually might switch to the-

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:47.980
Hey!

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:50.240
'Cease fire'? Never!

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:51.040
*giggles*

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:52.620
Hello! Boink.

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:54.900
Can I- No? Okay.

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:57.560
"You've bested me... I, the great Manuel!"

00:07:57.940 --> 00:08:01.380
"So long have I ruled these halls, only to be undone by the likes of you."

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:05.030
"The reign of Ser Manuel, master of the Gungeon ends unceremoniously"

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:07.080
