"Leave me here to die, again!"

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:10.100
Okay...

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:13.260
[laughing at the expense of Ser Manuel's misery]

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:14.120
Alright, move!

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:15.560
I did it! I'm the best!

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:16.180
Oh, hello.

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:17.820
Well, that was weird.

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:21.040
Things seem to be quite bullet-themed and I love it.

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:22.720
Oh man, this is so cool.

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:25.860
Oh, it just said 'generating'. It must be randomly generated for the most of it.

