Can I- Can I try

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:35.680
mouse and keyboard? Because I have a funny feeling that it's gonna be a little bit easier.

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:36.180
Hello!

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:39.740
"Oh, have you seen that misguided spirit, Ser Manuel?"

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:42.480
"He's stuck in those halls, lost. Sad, really."

00:08:42.969 --> 00:08:45.869
Okay, good for him! At least he taught me what I was supposed to be doing,

00:08:45.869 --> 00:08:48.829
other than you, teaching me that alcoholism is bad.

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:49.600
Hup!

00:08:50.140 --> 00:08:50.820
Hello!

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:52.120
Oh, hi again!

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:53.640
Wait. Oh, it's you.

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:55.800
"Forget how to dodge roll?" No, I'm good.

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:57.800
"Take the stairs back up to the breach!"

00:08:58.260 --> 00:08:59.700
No, wha- Whathe-

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:02.060
