00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:08.820
which would've been much, much much much much much more...

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:09.700
Interesting.

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:10.320
Hello!

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:12.740
Now excuse me, can I- please?

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:14.320
"You are now ready to Enter... the Gungeon."

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:15.140
Oh.

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:17.480
Well, thank you, I didn't know that I-

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:19.660
I didn't know that I needed to TALK my way through things.

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:21.220
I've only been taught to kill.

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:25.460
Literally, I'm completely bloodthirsty against anything that looks like a bullet, so...

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:27.900
I'm going to destroy everyone that I come across.

00:09:28.220 --> 00:09:29.420
... Except my little poochie-woochie!

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:30.460
Uh-oh.

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:32.000
That doesn't sound good.

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:38.280
... Weeell, that might've been a horrifying mistake. Hello, Desperado here.

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:39.300
So how do I...

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:42.450
See I- whoops, I didn't mean to do that.

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:44.440
Whoo, okay. Hang on.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.180
Alright, screw them! I'm going back to th-

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:49.040
I'm going back to this, because I don't know how to-

